            "text": "```python\ndef bank_rollback(balance, transactions):\n    current_balance = balance\n\n    for amount in transactions:\n        current_balance += amount\n\n        if current_balance < 0:\n            return balance, False\n\n    return current_balance, True\n```\n\n使用例：\n\n```python\nresult = bank_rollback(100, [50, -30, -200])\nprint(result)\n# (100, False)\n\nresult = bank_rollback(100, [50, -30, -20])\nprint(result)\n# (100, True)\n```\n\n各取引を順番に適用し、途中で残高がマイナスになった場合は、元の `balance` を返します。"
